      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper presents the design and evaluation of the Teacher Capability and School Resource Scale for Asthma Management. Based on a sample of 589 kindergarten to eighth grade teachers, the scale yielded two factors: the Teacher Capability in Social and Emotional Aspects of Asthma Management factor (alpha = 0.83) and the School Resources/Institutional Capability for Asthma Management (alpha = 0.86). This scale fills a needed gap in the literature regarding assessment tools for school-based asthma management that focus on teacher efficacy."},
